<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#09080d" />
  <meta name="description" content="Eclyps Productions es una productora creativa dedicada a desarrollar historias, producciones audiovisuales y experiencias digitales." />
  <title>Eclyps Productions® — Creamos mundos. Contamos historias.</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

    :root {
      --bg: #09080d;
      --surface: #111018;
      --surface-2: #171421;
      --text: #f5f2fa;
      --muted: #a7a1b3;
      --purple: #9b6cff;
      --purple-bright: #b99aff;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.11);
      --max: 1180px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 12%, rgba(117, 63, 205, .17), transparent 35%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 62%, rgba(75, 43, 132, .10), transparent 35%);
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    button { font: inherit; }
    .wrap { width: min(var(--max), calc(100% - 48px)); margin: auto; }

    .nav {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 20;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, backdrop-filter .35s;
    }
    .nav.scrolled {
      background: rgba(9,8,13,.78);
      border-color: var(--line);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }
    .nav-inner {
      height: 78px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .brand {
      font: 700 1.3rem "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
    }
    .brand span { color: var(--purple-bright); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 34px; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: #c7c1d0;
      font-size: .85rem;
      transition: color .25s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: white; }
    .nav-cta {
      border: 1px solid rgba(185,154,255,.5);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 11px 18px;
      color: white !important;
    }
    .menu-btn { display: none; background: none; color: white; border: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; }

    .hero {
      min-height: 850px;
      min-height: min(900px, 100svh);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      padding: 150px 0 100px;
    }
    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
      gap: 50px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--purple-bright);
      font-size: .72rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .24em;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--purple); }
    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
    h1 {
      font: 600 clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7.4rem)/.98 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: -.075em;
      margin: 26px 0;
    }
    h1 .accent {
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--purple-bright);
    }
    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 510px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-top: 34px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 15px 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: .88rem;
      transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s, background .25s, border-color .25s;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .btn-primary {
      color: #100b18;
      background: var(--purple-bright);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 35px rgba(155,108,255,.18);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 12px 45px rgba(155,108,255,.35); }
    .btn-ghost { border: 1px solid var(--line); color: white; }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: rgba(185,154,255,.65); }

    .orb-wrap { min-height: 430px; display: grid; place-items: center; position: relative; }
    .orb {
      width: min(390px, 75vw);
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: relative;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 35% 28%, rgba(255,255,255,.22), transparent 8%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 38% 35%, #8e5be7 0%, #472477 26%, #171020 58%, #09080d 72%);
      box-shadow: inset -30px -35px 65px rgba(0,0,0,.75), 0 0 100px rgba(137,83,225,.2);
      animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .orb::before, .orb::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(185,154,255,.28);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform: rotate(-24deg) scaleY(.34);
    }
    .orb::after { inset: -48px; transform: rotate(35deg) scaleY(.28); border-color: rgba(185,154,255,.15); }
    .orb-label {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 4%; right: -2%;
      color: #d7c5ff;
      font: 500 .72rem "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
    }
    .scroll-note {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 35px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      color: #777181;
      font-size: .68rem;
      letter-spacing: .2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section { padding: 125px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }
    .section h2 {
      font: 600 clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem)/1.02 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: -.065em;
      margin: 18px 0 0;
    }
    .section-intro { max-width: 360px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
    .about-statement {
      font: 500 clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 3rem)/1.2 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
    }
    .about-statement span { color: var(--purple-bright); }
    .about-detail { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.9; max-width: 500px; }

    .divisions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; }
    .division {
      min-height: 350px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 34px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.045), rgba(255,255,255,.012));
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform .4s, border-color .4s, background .4s;
    }
    .division:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); border-color: rgba(185,154,255,.5); background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(155,108,255,.12), rgba(255,255,255,.015)); }
    .division-number { color: var(--purple-bright); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .15em; }
    .division h3 { font: 600 2.1rem "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; margin: 65px 0 12px; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .division p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 390px; }
    .division-arrow { position: absolute; right: 32px; bottom: 30px; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--purple-bright); transition: transform .3s; }
    .division:hover .division-arrow { transform: translate(5px,-5px); }
    .division-glow {
      position: absolute; width: 220px; height: 220px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(133,83,215,.16); filter: blur(55px); right: -90px; top: -100px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .statement {
      padding: 145px 0;
      text-align: center;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(105,64,174,.16), transparent 62%);
    }
    .statement p {
      max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
      font: 500 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.8rem)/1.12 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: -.06em;
    }
    .statement span { color: var(--purple-bright); }

    .contact {
      border: 1px solid rgba(185,154,255,.25);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: clamp(30px, 6vw, 70px);
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(117,72,190,.16), rgba(255,255,255,.025));
      display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px;
    }
    .contact h2 { max-width: 650px; }
    footer { padding: 35px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .footer-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; color: #827b8e; font-size: .76rem; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }

    /* El contenido permanece visible por defecto (también en visores que bloquean JS).
       Las animaciones se activan únicamente cuando JavaScript está disponible. */
    .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    .js .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity .8s ease, transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
    .js .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    .delay-1 { transition-delay: .12s; }
    .delay-2 { transition-delay: .24s; }
    .delay-3 { transition-delay: .36s; }

    @keyframes float { 0%,100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-7deg); } 50% { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(5deg); } }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .nav-inner { height: 68px; }
      .menu-btn { display: block; }
      .nav-links {
        display: none; position: absolute; top: 68px; left: 0; right: 0;
        padding: 25px 24px 30px; background: rgba(9,8,13,.97);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 22px;
      }
      .nav-links.open { display: flex; }
      .hero { min-height: auto; padding: 145px 0 100px; }
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
      .orb-wrap { min-height: 340px; }
      .orb { width: 260px; }
      .orb-label { right: 10%; }
      .scroll-note { display: none; }
      .section { padding: 90px 0; }
      .section-head, .about-grid, .contact { display: block; }
      .section-intro { margin-top: 22px; }
      .about-grid { gap: 25px; }
      .about-detail { margin-top: 25px; }
      .divisions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .division { min-height: 300px; }
      .division h3 { margin-top: 48px; }
      .contact .btn { margin-top: 28px; }
      .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; animation-duration: .01ms !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
      .js .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }
  
    /* Normativa general */
    .rules-section { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .rules-section::before { content:""; position:absolute; width:520px; height:520px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(117,63,205,.10); filter:blur(100px); right:-260px; top:100px; pointer-events:none; }
    .rules-gradient { color:transparent; background:linear-gradient(100deg,#c8adff,#8754dc 65%,#e0d4ff); -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; }
    .rules-banner { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:22px; padding:24px 28px; margin-bottom:26px; border:1px solid rgba(185,154,255,.25); border-radius:20px; background:linear-gradient(110deg,rgba(155,108,255,.13),rgba(255,255,255,.025)); }
    .rules-banner-mark { width:52px; height:52px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid rgba(185,154,255,.45); border-radius:15px; font:700 1.25rem "Space Grotesk"; color:#fff; box-shadow:0 0 35px rgba(155,108,255,.16); flex:none; }
    .rules-banner-mark span { color:var(--purple-bright); }
    .rules-banner strong { font:600 1rem "Space Grotesk"; }
    .rules-banner p { margin:5px 0 0; color:var(--muted); font-size:.88rem; line-height:1.6; }
    .rules-meta { margin-left:auto; display:grid; text-align:right; }
    .rules-meta span { font:600 2rem "Space Grotesk"; color:var(--purple-bright); }
    .rules-meta small,.rules-aside-label { color:#817a90; letter-spacing:.18em; font-size:.62rem; }
    .rules-toolbar { display:flex; gap:12px; margin:0 0 20px; }
    .rules-search { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; flex:1; border:1px solid var(--line); background:rgba(255,255,255,.035); border-radius:12px; padding:0 16px; min-height:52px; color:var(--purple-bright); }
    .rules-search span { font-size:1.5rem; }
    .rules-search input { width:100%; background:transparent; color:white; border:0; outline:0; font:inherit; font-size:.88rem; }
    .rules-search input::placeholder { color:#817b8c; }
    .rules-search kbd { white-space:nowrap; color:#80798b; border:1px solid var(--line); padding:3px 6px; border-radius:5px; font-size:.65rem; }
    .rules-expand { border:1px solid var(--line); background:rgba(255,255,255,.035); color:#e8e1f3; border-radius:12px; padding:0 17px; cursor:pointer; transition:.25s; }
    .rules-expand:hover { border-color:rgba(185,154,255,.55); background:rgba(155,108,255,.1); }
    .rules-layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:210px 1fr; gap:28px; align-items:start; }
    .rules-aside { position:sticky; top:105px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; padding:8px 0; }
    .rules-aside-label { margin:0 0 10px 12px; }
    .rules-aside a { color:#aaa3b6; padding:9px 12px; border-radius:8px; font-size:.78rem; transition:.2s; }
    .rules-aside a:hover,.rules-aside a.active { color:white; background:rgba(155,108,255,.12); }
    .rules-aside-note { margin:20px 8px 0; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); color:#817b8b; font-size:.72rem; line-height:1.7; }
    .rules-list { display:grid; gap:10px; }
    .rule-card { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:15px; overflow:hidden; background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(255,255,255,.045),rgba(255,255,255,.015)); transition:border-color .3s,transform .3s,background .3s; }
    .rule-card:hover { border-color:rgba(185,154,255,.35); transform:translateY(-2px); }
    .rule-card.open { border-color:rgba(185,154,255,.48); background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(155,108,255,.09),rgba(255,255,255,.018)); }
    .rule-toggle { width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:18px; padding:20px 22px; color:white; text-align:left; border:0; background:transparent; cursor:pointer; }
    .rule-index { color:var(--purple-bright); font:600 .76rem "Space Grotesk"; letter-spacing:.08em; }
    .rule-title { flex:1; font:600 1rem "Space Grotesk"; }
    .rule-plus { width:28px; height:28px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:50%; color:var(--purple-bright); font-size:1.15rem; transition:transform .3s,background .3s; }
    .rule-card.open .rule-plus { transform:rotate(45deg); background:rgba(155,108,255,.15); }
    .rule-content { display:grid; grid-template-rows:0fr; transition:grid-template-rows .4s ease; }
    .rule-card.open .rule-content { display:block; }
    .rule-content-inner { padding:0 26px 24px 62px; animation:ruleIn .35s ease both; }
    .rule-text { color:#bcb5c8; font-size:.86rem; line-height:1.85; margin:0 0 12px; }
    .rule-text strong { color:#f2eaff; }
    .rule-subitem { list-style:none; color:#aaa3b6; font-size:.84rem; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 9px; padding-left:18px; position:relative; }
    .rule-subitem::before { content:""; position:absolute; left:0; top:.8em; width:5px; height:5px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--purple-bright); }
    .rule-bullet { list-style:none; color:#aaa3b6; font-size:.84rem; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 7px; padding-left:18px; position:relative; }
    .rule-bullet::before { content:""; position:absolute; left:0; top:.8em; width:5px; height:5px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--purple-bright); }
    .rule-card[hidden] { display:none; }
    .rules-footer { margin-top:30px; padding:30px; border:1px solid rgba(185,154,255,.22); border-radius:18px; background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0,rgba(155,108,255,.12),transparent 75%); text-align:center; }
    .rules-footer p { max-width:780px; margin:0 auto 18px; color:#e4d9f7; font:500 clamp(1.1rem,2.3vw,1.6rem)/1.5 "Space Grotesk"; }
    .rules-footer span { color:#837b90; font-size:.62rem; letter-spacing:.22em; }
    @keyframes ruleIn { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(-7px); } to { opacity:1; transform:none; } }
    @media(max-width:800px) { .rules-layout { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .rules-aside { position:static; display:flex; flex-direction:row; overflow:auto; padding:0 0 8px; } .rules-aside-label,.rules-aside-note { display:none; } .rules-aside a { white-space:nowrap; border:1px solid var(--line); } }
    @media(max-width:560px) { .rules-banner { padding:18px; gap:13px; } .rules-banner-mark { width:42px;height:42px; } .rules-meta { display:none; } .rules-toolbar { flex-direction:column; } .rules-expand { min-height:45px; } .rule-toggle { padding:17px 15px; gap:12px; } .rule-title { font-size:.9rem; } .rule-content-inner { padding:0 17px 20px 45px; } }

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="nav" id="navbar">
    <div class="wrap nav-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Eclyps, inicio">ECLYPS<span>®</span></a>
      <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Abrir menú" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
      <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <a href="#nosotros">Nosotros</a>
        <a href="#divisiones">Divisiones</a>
        <a href="#normativa">Normativa</a>
        <a href="#contacto" class="nav-cta">Contacto ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow reveal">Productora creativa independiente</div>
          <h1 class="reveal delay-1">Historias que<br><span class="accent">trascienden.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-copy reveal delay-2">Somos Eclyps Productions: una productora dedicada a crear contenido audiovisual, desarrollar universos narrativos y dar vida a experiencias digitales.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions reveal delay-3">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#divisiones">Conoce nuestras ramas <span>↗</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#nosotros">Qué es Eclyps</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="orb-wrap reveal delay-2" aria-label="Elemento visual abstracto morado">
          <div class="orb"></div>
          <div class="orb-label">BEYOND THE ORDINARY / 001</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-note">Desliza para descubrir ↓</div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="nosotros">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow reveal">01 / Qué es Eclyps Productions</div>
            <h2 class="reveal delay-1">Creatividad<br>en movimiento.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-intro reveal delay-2">Eclyps Productions es una productora creativa que reúne proyectos audiovisuales y experiencias digitales bajo una misma identidad.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <p class="about-statement reveal">Creamos ideas.<br><span>Les damos vida.</span></p>
          <p class="about-detail reveal delay-1">Nuestro trabajo combina producción audiovisual, creatividad y desarrollo de experiencias interactivas. Creamos historias y proyectos digitales pensados para entretener, conectar comunidades y construir mundos propios. Eclyps Productions funciona como el proyecto principal del que nacen distintas ramas creativas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="divisiones">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow reveal">02 / Nuestras ramas</div>
            <h2 class="reveal delay-1">Un proyecto.<br>Distintos mundos.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-intro reveal delay-2">Eclyps Productions reúne distintas iniciativas. Cada rama tiene su propio enfoque, pero comparte nuestra identidad creativa.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="divisions">
          <a class="division reveal" href="#contacto">
            <div class="division-glow"></div>
            <div class="division-number">PROYECTO PRINCIPAL / AUDIOVISUAL</div>
            <h3>Producciones</h3>
            <p>Desarrollamos cortometrajes, historias cinematográficas y contenido audiovisual, especialmente dentro de plataformas como Roblox y Minecraft.</p>
            <span class="division-arrow">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a class="division reveal delay-1" href="#contacto">
            <div class="division-glow"></div>
            <div class="division-number">RAMA 001 / ROLEPLAY</div>
            <h3>Eclyps RP</h3>
            <p>Nuestra rama dedicada al roleplay: experiencias narrativas donde la comunidad puede interpretar personajes, desarrollar historias y formar parte de un mundo compartido.</p>
            <span class="division-arrow">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    
  <section class="section rules-section" id="normativa">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head rules-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Marco de convivencia · Eclyps</div>
          <h2>Normativa<br><span class="rules-gradient">general.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-intro">Reglas de convivencia y funcionamiento para el servidor de rol de Brookhaven (Roblox) y su comunidad de Discord.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rules-banner">
        <div class="rules-banner-mark">E<span>/</span></div>
        <div>
          <strong>Lee antes de participar.</strong>
          <p>La permanencia en el servidor implica el conocimiento y la aceptación íntegra de este reglamento.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rules-meta"><span>08</span><small>ARTÍCULOS</small></div>
      </div>

      <div class="rules-toolbar">
        <label class="rules-search">
          <span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
          <input id="ruleSearch" type="search" placeholder="Buscar una regla, sanción o concepto..." aria-label="Buscar en la normativa">
